{
  "name": "4gl-full",
  "displayName": "Genero BDL (4GL)",
  "description": "Genero BDL（.4gl）与 Form（.per）的完整语言支持：语法高亮、定义/引用跳转、符号大纲、悬停、语法诊断。",
  "version": "0.6.2",
  "publisher": "darcyjoven",
  "license": "MIT",
  "icon": "icon.png",
  "engines": {
    "vscode": "^1.91.0"
  },
  "categories": [
    "Programming Languages",
    "Linters"
  ],
  "keywords": [
    "genero",
    "bdl",
    "4gl",
    "per",
    "form",
    "fgl"
  ],
  "main": "./dist/extension.js",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "https://github.com/darcyjoven/vscode-bdl.git"
  },
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/darcyjoven/vscode-bdl/issues"
  },
  "activationEvents": [
    "onLanguage:bdl",
    "onLanguage:per",
    "onCommand:bdl.forceParseCurrentFile",
    "onCommand:bdl.migrateLinkDir",
    "onCommand:bdl.link.importCsv",
    "onCommand:bdl.link.syncModules",
    "onCommand:bdl.link.syncAll",
    "onCommand:bdl.link.status",
    "onCommand:bdl.link.updateFromDb",
    "onCommand:bdl.build.4gl.preview",
    "onCommand:bdl.build.4gl.compile",
    "onCommand:bdl.build.4gl.link",
    "onCommand:bdl.build.per.preview",
    "onCommand:bdl.build.per.compile",
    "onCommand:bdl.build.per.form",
    "onCommand:bdl.schema.import",
    "onCommand:bdl.schema.refresh",
    "onCommand:bdl.schema.filter",
    "onCommand:bdl.schema.clearFilter",
    "onCommand:bdl.schema.syncTable",
    "onCommand:bdl.schema.copyColumn",
    "onCommand:bdl.schema.openTable",
    "onCommand:bdl.schema.syncAll",
    "onCommand:bdl.schema.syncSelected",
    "onCommand:bdl.schema.selectAll",
    "onCommand:bdl.schema.clearSelection",
    "onCommand:bdl.initProject"
  ],
  "contributes": {
    "languages": [
      {
        "id": "bdl",
        "aliases": [
          "Genero BDL",
          "bdl",
          "4gl"
        ],
        "extensions": [
          ".4gl",
          ".global"
        ],
        "configuration": "./language-configuration/bdl.json"
      },
      {
        "id": "per",
        "aliases": [
          "Genero Form",
          "per"
        ],
        "extensions": [
          ".per"
        ],
        "configuration": "./language-configuration/per.json"
      }
    ],
    "grammars": [
      {
        "language": "bdl",
        "scopeName": "source.4gl",
        "path": "./syntaxes/bdl.tmLanguage.json"
      },
      {
        "language": "per",
        "scopeName": "source.per",
        "path": "./syntaxes/per.tmLanguage.json"
      }
    ],
    "configuration": [
      {
        "title": "基本设置",
        "properties": {
          "bdl.server.path": {
            "type": "string",
            "default": "",
            "scope": "machine-overridable",
            "markdownDescription": "`bdl-lsp` 可执行文件路径（文件或所在目录）。留空时依次查找：环境变量 `BDL_LSP_PATH`、扩展内置 `bin/`、工作区 `.bdl-lsp/bin/bdl-lsp`、系统 `PATH`。修改后需重启语言服务器。\n\n平台安装包已内置语言服务器，通常不需要设置此项。"
          },
          "bdl.tools.path": {
            "type": "string",
            "default": "",
            "markdownDescription": "`tiptop` 可执行文件的路径（可填文件或所在目录）。tiptop 负责采集链接资料与部署，从语言服务器分离而来。留空时按以下顺序查找：环境变量 `TIPTOP_PATH` → 扩展内置 `bin/tiptop` → 工作区 `.bdl-lsp/bin/tiptop` → 系统 `PATH`。"
          },
          "bdl.server.logLevel": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "error",
              "warn",
              "info",
              "debug"
            ],
            "default": "info",
            "scope": "machine-overridable",
            "markdownDescription": "语言服务器日志级别。日志同时写入扩展日志目录。修改后需重启语言服务器。"
          },
          "bdl.trace.server": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "off",
              "messages",
              "verbose"
            ],
            "default": "off",
            "description": "记录客户端与语言服务器之间的 LSP 消息（输出到「Genero BDL 追踪」通道）。"
          },
          "bdl.generoVersion": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "2.50",
              "3.00",
              "4.00"
            ],
            "default": "2.50",
            "scope": "window",
            "markdownDescription": "目标 Genero 版本。当前语法基线为 **2.50**；更高版本的差异尚未实现。"
          },
          "bdl.diagnostics": {
            "type": "object",
            "default": {},
            "scope": "window",
            "additionalProperties": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "off",
                "error",
                "warning",
                "information",
                "hint"
              ]
            },
            "markdownDescription": "诊断级别的唯一入口：按诊断码覆盖。键为诊断码，值为 `off`/`error`/`warning`/`information`/`hint`；未列出的码使用默认级别（除 `record-member-unknown` 默认 off、`link-data-stale` 默认 hint、`file-too-large` 默认 information 外，其余默认 warning）。\n\n可用诊断码：`syntax-error`、`missing-node`（MISSING 整簇，也可精确到 `missing-<kind>`）、`globals-file-not-found`、`variable-source-unresolved`、`field-not-in-form`、`form-duplicate-item`、`form-layout-tag-undefined`、`form-screen-record-undefined`、`record-member-unknown`、`file-too-large`、`function-not-found`、`link-data-invalid`、`link-data-stale`。\n\n示例：\n```jsonc\n\"bdl.diagnostics\": {\n  \"variable-source-unresolved\": \"warning\",\n  \"record-member-unknown\": \"off\",\n  \"syntax-error\": \"error\"\n}\n```"
          },
          "bdl.format.keywords": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "unchanged",
              "upper",
              "lower"
            ],
            "default": "unchanged",
            "scope": "window",
            "markdownDescription": "格式化时关键字的大小写处理：`unchanged` 保持不变、`upper` 转大写、`lower` 转小写。\n\n设为 `lower` 时，关键字补全也用同样的小写字形；其它取值补全保持原字形。\n\n仅改写关键字本身，不动空白、标点与换行；含语法错误的文件整体跳过格式化。"
          },
          "bdl.format.indentStyle": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "auto",
              "tab",
              "space"
            ],
            "default": "auto",
            "scope": "window",
            "markdownDescription": "格式化时的缩进字符：`auto` 跟随编辑器 `editor.insertSpaces` 设置、`tab` 强制制表符、`space` 强制空格。"
          },
          "bdl.format.indentSize": {
            "type": "number",
            "default": 0,
            "minimum": 0,
            "maximum": 16,
            "scope": "window",
            "markdownDescription": "每级缩进的宽度（`indentStyle` 为 `space` 时的空格数，为 `tab` 时仅影响显示宽度）。`0` 表示跟随编辑器 `editor.tabSize`。"
          },
          "bdl.index.enable": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "default": true,
            "scope": "window",
            "description": "在工作区后台建立符号索引（全工作区符号搜索、跨文件跳转与引用的基础）。关闭后这些功能只覆盖已打开的文件。"
          },
          "bdl.globals.searchPaths": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "default": [],
            "scope": "window",
            "markdownDescription": "GLOBALS 文件路径的附加解析根（相对工作区根，按序尝试）。适用于引用写法按引用文件目录解析不到、但文件在工作区其他位置的场景（如各模块目录层级不一致的 `../../config/top.global`）。"
          },
          "bdl.perRoots": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "default": [],
            "scope": "window",
            "markdownDescription": "`.per` 表单文件的附加查找根（相对工作区根，按序尝试）。表单路径先按 `4gl 同级 per 目录` 解析，失败后尝试这些根，最后按 basename 在工作区内唯一匹配。"
          },
          "bdl.builtins.enable": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "default": true,
            "scope": "window",
            "markdownDescription": "是否启用内置符号表（Genero 自带的变量/函数/类名）。\n\n关闭后 `STATUS`/`SQLCA`/`INT_FLAG`/`fgl_*`/`ui.*` 等名字会重新报“无法确定变量来源”（即 P7-C 之前的行为），一般不需要关。"
          },
          "bdl.builtins.paths": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "default": [],
            "scope": "window",
            "markdownDescription": "额外的内置符号覆盖文件或目录（相对工作区根，按序加载，后者覆盖前者；目录里所有 `*.json` 都会加载）。\n\n项目约定路径 `.bdl-lsp/builtins.json` 会自动加载，不需要写在这里。"
          },
          "bdl.builtins.disable": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "default": [],
            "scope": "window",
            "markdownDescription": "关闭指定的内置名（大小写不敏感），优先级高于任何覆盖文件。\n\n典型用途：项目里自己定义了同名函数，不想被内置表“吞掉”。\n\n示例：`[\"SUM\", \"LENGTH\"]`"
          },
          "bdl.ignore.files": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "default": [],
            "scope": "window",
            "markdownDescription": "整文件忽略诊断的 glob（工作区相对路径，`**` 跨目录；不含 `/` 的模式也按文件名匹配）。命中的文件不发布任何诊断，也不进入工作区符号索引。\n\n例：`[\"build/**\", \"**/*.bak.4gl\"]`"
          },
          "bdl.ignore.fields": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "default": [],
            "scope": "window",
            "markdownDescription": "忽略 `field-not-in-form` 的字段名 glob（大小写不敏感）。\n\n例：`[\"tmp_*\", \"legacy.field\"]`"
          },
          "bdl.ignore.forms": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "default": [],
            "scope": "window",
            "markdownDescription": "忽略某张表单的全部字段类诊断的 glob（匹配表单字面量、文件名或相对路径，大小写不敏感）。\n\n例：`[\"cust\", \"**/per/old.per\"]`"
          },
          "bdl.limits.maxFileBytes": {
            "type": "number",
            "default": 2097152,
            "scope": "window",
            "description": "超过该字节数的文件不做语法诊断（仍可高亮与跳转）。"
          },
          "bdl.limits.maxFileLines": {
            "type": "number",
            "default": 20000,
            "scope": "window",
            "description": "超过该行数的文件不做语法诊断。"
          },
          "bdl.limits.maxIssues": {
            "type": "number",
            "default": 200,
            "scope": "window",
            "description": "单个文件最多报告的诊断条数，防止极端文件刷屏。"
          },
          "bdl.limits.parseTimeoutMs": {
            "type": "number",
            "default": 2000,
            "scope": "window",
            "description": "单次解析的超时时间（毫秒）。超时后保留上一次诊断。"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "title": "账号、生产环境、配置",
        "properties": {
          "bdl.prod.oracle.host": {
            "type": "string",
            "default": "",
            "scope": "window",
            "markdownDescription": "Oracle 主机（示例 `oracle`）。只在链接/字段资料模式选了「连接数据库」时使用。"
          },
          "bdl.prod.oracle.port": {
            "type": "number",
            "default": 1521,
            "scope": "window",
            "markdownDescription": "Oracle 端口，默认 `1521`。"
          },
          "bdl.prod.oracle.service": {
            "type": "string",
            "default": "",
            "scope": "window",
            "markdownDescription": "Oracle 服务名（示例 `PROD`）。**连接必需**。"
          },
          "bdl.prod.oracle.user": {
            "type": "string",
            "default": "",
            "scope": "window",
            "markdownDescription": "Oracle 账号（示例 `user`）。请用**应用 schema 账号**：字段资料的默认 SQL 走 `USER_TAB_COLUMNS` + TiTop 字典 `DS.ZTA_FILE`/`DS.GAQ_FILE`，需要账号自己拥有这些表并能读字典表。密码**不在这里**，放 `<项目>/.project/secrets.json`（0600）或环境变量 `BDL_ORA_PASSWORD`。"
          },
          "bdl.prod.deploy.host": {
            "type": "string",
            "default": "",
            "scope": "window",
            "markdownDescription": "生产服务器主机（示例 `erp`）。SSH **密钥登录，不支持密码**。"
          },
          "bdl.prod.deploy.port": {
            "type": "number",
            "default": 22,
            "scope": "window",
            "markdownDescription": "SSH 端口，默认 `22`。"
          },
          "bdl.prod.deploy.user": {
            "type": "string",
            "default": "",
            "scope": "window",
            "markdownDescription": "SSH 账号（示例 `tiptop`）。请配置 SSH 密钥，不要用密码明文登录。"
          },
          "bdl.prod.deploy.strictHostKey": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "default": true,
            "scope": "window",
            "markdownDescription": "严格校验 host key（默认打开）。换主机后首次连接会失败，可改用 `accept-new` 语义（关掉本项），不会静默接受任何主机。"
          },
          "bdl.link.mode": {
            "type": "string",
            "default": "off",
            "scope": "window",
            "enum": [
              "off",
              "file",
              "db"
            ],
            "enumDescriptions": [
              "不启用（视图、诊断、命令全关）",
              "只用 CSV 导入",
              "允许连接数据库同步/更新（也可 CSV 导入）"
            ],
            "markdownDescription": "链接资料功能：`off` 不启用；`file` 只用 CSV 导入；`db` 允许连数据库同步/更新。"
          },
          "bdl.link.dataDir": {
            "type": "string",
            "default": ".project/link",
            "scope": "window",
            "markdownDescription": "链接资料目录（相对工作区根）。旧布局 `.project` 根 / `.link/` 仍兼容读取。"
          },
          "bdl.link.moduleRoots": {
            "type": "array",
            "default": [],
            "scope": "window",
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "markdownDescription": "模组根（相对工作区根）。留空自动探测；项目结构特殊时再配。"
          },
          "bdl.link.globalModules": {
            "type": "array",
            "default": [
              "sub",
              "lib",
              "qry"
            ],
            "scope": "window",
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "markdownDescription": "对所有程序可见的全局模组（扁平规则）。"
          },
          "bdl.schema.mode": {
            "type": "string",
            "default": "off",
            "scope": "window",
            "enum": [
              "off",
              "file",
              "db"
            ],
            "enumDescriptions": [
              "不启用（视图、诊断、命令全关）",
              "只用 CSV 导入",
              "允许连接数据库同步（也可 CSV 导入）"
            ],
            "markdownDescription": "数据库字段功能：`off` 不启用；`file` 只用 CSV 导入；`db` 允许连数据库同步。"
          },
          "bdl.schema.dataDir": {
            "type": "string",
            "default": ".project/schema",
            "scope": "window",
            "markdownDescription": "字段资料目录（相对工作区根）。旧布局 `.project/.schema` 仍兼容读取。"
          },
          "bdl.schema.batchSize": {
            "type": "number",
            "default": 200,
            "scope": "window",
            "markdownDescription": "「从数据库同步」每批查几张表（默认 200；`0` = 不分批）。慢链路可调小。"
          },
          "bdl.schema.timeoutSec": {
            "type": "number",
            "default": 120,
            "scope": "window",
            "markdownDescription": "「从数据库同步」单批查询超时秒数（默认 120）。慢链路可加大。"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "title": "上传编译链接",
        "properties": {
          "bdl.deploy.enable": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "default": false,
            "scope": "window",
            "markdownDescription": "上传 / 编译链接预览功能总开关（默认关）。关闭后相关命令隐藏。"
          },
          "bdl.prod.deploy.transport": {
            "type": "string",
            "default": "off",
            "scope": "window",
            "enum": [
              "off",
              "rsync",
              "scp"
            ],
            "enumDescriptions": [
              "不上传（隐藏上传命令）",
              "rsync 上传，失败回退 scp",
              "只用 scp"
            ],
            "markdownDescription": "上传方式（**只上传当前文件**，不做批量同步）：「工作区根 → 生产根」同路径映射。"
          },
          "bdl.prod.deploy.localRoot": {
            "type": "string",
            "default": ".",
            "scope": "window",
            "markdownDescription": "项目根目录（相对工作区根），默认 `.`。"
          },
          "bdl.prod.deploy.remoteRoot": {
            "type": "string",
            "default": "",
            "scope": "window",
            "markdownDescription": "生产根目录（POSIX 绝对路径，示例 `/u1/toppord`）。上传落点与编译/链接/预览的工作目录都在它下面。"
          },
          "bdl.build.enable": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "default": false,
            "scope": "window",
            "markdownDescription": "编译 / 链接 / 预览总开关（默认关）。命令在**生产服务器**上执行。"
          },
          "bdl.build.4gl.preview.command": {
            "type": "string",
            "default": "cd ${path} && r.c2 ${name}",
            "scope": "window",
            "markdownDescription": "4gl 预演编译命令模板。占位符：`${path}` 两层目录（如 `axc/4gl`）、`${fullpath}` 三层目录（如 `tiptop/axc/4gl`）、`${name}` 去扩展名、`${fullname}` 含扩展名；分隔符恒为 `/`。命令在**生产服务器**上执行（工作目录 = 生产根目录），stdout/stderr 原样进「Genero BDL 编译」。"
          },
          "bdl.build.4gl.compile.command": {
            "type": "string",
            "default": "cd ${path} && r.c2 ${name}",
            "scope": "window",
            "markdownDescription": "4gl 编译命令模板。占位符：`${path}` 两层目录（如 `axc/4gl`）、`${fullpath}` 三层目录（如 `tiptop/axc/4gl`）、`${name}` 去扩展名、`${fullname}` 含扩展名；分隔符恒为 `/`。命令在**生产服务器**上执行（工作目录 = 生产根目录），stdout/stderr 原样进「Genero BDL 编译」。"
          },
          "bdl.build.4gl.link.command": {
            "type": "string",
            "default": "r.l2 ${name}",
            "scope": "window",
            "markdownDescription": "4gl 链接命令模板。4GL 链接：文件不含 `MAIN` 程序块时本地直接报错、不执行；每次点会弹 `${name}` 确认。占位符：`${path}` 两层目录（如 `axc/4gl`）、`${fullpath}` 三层目录（如 `tiptop/axc/4gl`）、`${name}` 去扩展名、`${fullname}` 含扩展名；分隔符恒为 `/`。命令在**生产服务器**上执行（工作目录 = 生产根目录），stdout/stderr 原样进「Genero BDL 编译」。"
          },
          "bdl.build.per.preview.command": {
            "type": "string",
            "default": "cd ${path} && fglform -M -W all ${fullname} && rm ${name}.42f",
            "scope": "window",
            "markdownDescription": "per 预演编译命令模板。占位符：`${path}` 两层目录（如 `axc/4gl`）、`${fullpath}` 三层目录（如 `tiptop/axc/4gl`）、`${name}` 去扩展名、`${fullname}` 含扩展名；分隔符恒为 `/`。命令在**生产服务器**上执行（工作目录 = 生产根目录），stdout/stderr 原样进「Genero BDL 编译」。"
          },
          "bdl.build.per.compile.command": {
            "type": "string",
            "default": "cd ${path} && fglform -M -W all ${fullname} && mv ${name}.42f ../42f/ && gsform -M -W all -i -import ${fullname} && mv ${name}.4fd ../4fd/",
            "scope": "window",
            "markdownDescription": "per 编译命令模板。占位符：`${path}` 两层目录（如 `axc/4gl`）、`${fullpath}` 三层目录（如 `tiptop/axc/4gl`）、`${name}` 去扩展名、`${fullname}` 含扩展名；分隔符恒为 `/`。命令在**生产服务器**上执行（工作目录 = 生产根目录），stdout/stderr 原样进「Genero BDL 编译」。"
          },
          "bdl.build.per.form.command": {
            "type": "string",
            "default": "cd ${path} && r.gf ${name} 2 p",
            "scope": "window",
            "markdownDescription": "per 预览画面命令模板。占位符：`${path}` 两层目录（如 `axc/4gl`）、`${fullpath}` 三层目录（如 `tiptop/axc/4gl`）、`${name}` 去扩展名、`${fullname}` 含扩展名；分隔符恒为 `/`。命令在**生产服务器**上执行（工作目录 = 生产根目录），stdout/stderr 原样进「Genero BDL 编译」。"
          }
        }
      }
    ],
    "configurationDefaults": {
      "[bdl]": {
        "editor.defaultFormatter": "darcyjoven.4gl-full"
      }
    },
